{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4323","title":"Xiaomi Unveils Latest AIoT Offerings for a Smarter, Stylish, and Connected Lifestyle","desc":"Xiaomi today introduces its latest lineup of innovative devices: Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro, Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi), Xiaomi Watch S4, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max, and Xiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro in a new color variant.","view_cnt":"7823","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1740399733","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/301_operatorx_operatorx_opx/24/02/2025/eeb1e42ec02bcf0e56949e1164b794c3.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e[Barcelona, Spain, March 2, 2025]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi, a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (IoT) platform at its core, today introduces its latest lineup of innovative devices: Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro, Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi), Xiaomi Watch S4, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max, and Xiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro in a new color variant. From immersive entertainment to fitness, fashion, and smart mobility, Xiaomi has enriched its AIoT portfolio, reinforcing its commitment to innovation across multiple lifestyle categories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro:\u0026nbsp;Premium Audio for Your\u0026nbsp;Daily Soundtrack\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro redefines wireless audio with Snapdragon Sound™ Technology Suite and Qualcomm® aptX™ Lossless technology,¹ delivering 48kHz/24bit sound at a high transmission bandwidth of up to 2.1Mbps.² Featuring a dual-amplifier coaxial triple-driver system, it ensures deep bass, balanced mids, and an expansive soundstage. Master tuning by the Harman Golden Ear Team enhances the listening experience with two professionally crafted EQ profiles. With up to 55dB hybrid active noise cancellation (ANC),³ Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro can adapt to different environments, blocking distractions. It is designed for everyday convenience and supports dual-device connectivity, personalized dimensional audio,⁴ and an extended battery life for uninterrupted listening. Including the case battery, you can get up to 40 hours of battery life⁵ and 4.5 hours of playback with just 10 minutes of fast charging.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eBuilt-in audio recording lets users capture important conversations by pressing the case button three times.⁶ The case itself serves as a recording trigger, enabling users to start voice capture—perfect for meetings or quick memos. Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro also supports AI-powered translation and transcription,⁷ providing seamless multilingual assistance with a quick gesture. In addition, press controls enable simple pinch gestures for music playback, call management, ANC adjustment, voice assistant activation, and audio recording, while swipe controls provide convenient volume adjustments.⁸\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi): Lossless Sound, Elevated Listening\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi also introduces Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi), its first earbuds to support direct Wi-Fi connectivity with smartphones, offering an industry-leading lossless audio experience. Powered by Snapdragon Sound™ Technology Suite and Qualcomm® XPAN technology,¹ it supports 96kHz/24bit lossless transmission at a bandwidth of up to 4.2Mbps for an unmatched, high-fidelity sound experience.⁹ Building on its advanced triple-driver system, Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi) refines every detail, delivering deep bass, crisp highs, and an expansive soundstage. It features specialized EQ profiles and offers a more refined and immersive sound experience, ensuring every detail is perfectly tuned for your listening pleasure.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eWith up to 40 hours of battery life (with the case) and 4 hours of playback from just 10 minutes of charging,⁵ Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi) offers a seamless listening experience for any lifestyle. Available in Translucent Black, it exudes a futuristic and sophisticated aesthetic. The high-quality finish combines a sleek, glossy surface with subtle matte textures, offering a premium feel that complements its advanced capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/206_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/02/2025/30c9bd6a4fcf39f1a7c855c27acbb4fd.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Watch S4: A Stylish Companion for Health and Productivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Watch S4 delivers a premium viewing experience with its 1.43-inch AMOLED display, featuring 466 x 466 resolution, 326 ppi, and a smooth 60Hz refresh rate.¹⁰ With 1500 nits HBM brightness, the screen remains vibrant even in direct sunlight. Its 15-day battery life ensures long-lasting performance, while a quick 5-minute charge provides up to 2 days of usage.¹¹ Designed for versatility, Xiaomi Watch S4 features interchangeable bezels and straps, allowing users to switch between various unique styles. Functional dials such as Clearheaded automatically track stress levels with expressive emoji indicators and Wild Walker provides real-time direction and altitude.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eFor fitness and health tracking, powered by an upgraded self-developed algorithm, it provides all-day monitoring of heart rate, blood oxygen, stress levels, and sleep patterns. With heart rate monitoring accuracy reaching 98%,¹² it offers trustworthy, multidimensional health analysis. Xiaomi Watch S4 also offers one-tap health insights,¹³ generating a detailed health report in around 60 seconds, along with breathing training courses. Advanced L1+L5 GNSS technology ensures precise location tracking and pace monitoring for outdoor workouts, complemented by over 150 sports modes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Watch S4 offers seamless integration with Xiaomi Smart Hub,¹⁴ enabling users to effortlessly connect their Xiaomi smartphones, tablets, earbuds,²⁷ and smart home devices for enhanced device management.²⁸ This advanced connectivity allows users to easily find their phone or tablet through the ringing function, remotely capture photos, and manage earbuds settings—such as adjusting volume, switching noise reduction modes, and monitoring battery levels in real time. It also introduces innovative quick gestures, like snapping fingers to reject calls or dismiss notifications to enhance everyday convenience, making it a truly smart lifestyle companion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/487_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/02/2025/55794f6d18d4e7fa231533d2f585330f.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max: A Smarter, Smoother Ride\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max redefines urban commuting with an upgraded front dual hydraulic-spring and rear dual-spring suspension system, providing a smoother ride, reducing numbness in hands and feet, and improving overall comfort, even on uneven roads. Additionally, this system reduces wear and tear, extending the scooter's lifespan for long-term reliability.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max also features smart energy recovery, converting kinetic energy into battery power while in motion. It also intelligently detects slopes, adjusting energy recovery levels to ensure a smoother, more controlled descent. Combined with smart slope parking, which temporarily holds the scooter in place on slopes without manual effort, it enhances stability and provides a more effortless riding experience on varied terrain. A powerful 1000W motor¹⁵ enables rapid acceleration to a max speed of 25km/h¹⁶ and a 22% incline capability¹⁷, making urban commutes effortless. The maximum load capacity of 120kg makes it suitable for a wider range of riders.¹⁷ The increased deck area provides a more stable standing platform, and a longer handlebar makes handling easier. In comparison, the higher stem ensures a better fit for a broader range of riders. With a 60km travel range¹⁸, it reduces the need for frequent charging, while fast charging fully recharges the battery in just 3 hours.¹⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max also integrates a TCS (Traction Control System) for excellent stability on wet roads. Using a gyroscope sensor and intelligent controller algorithm, it detects wheel slippage and automatically adjusts motor power output. This prevents skidding and improves traction, ensuring a safer, more controlled ride. And auto light mode automatically activates the front light and taillight in low-light conditions,²⁰ while new ambient light enhances visibility on dark roads, ensuring a safer riding experience.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/138_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/02/2025/03fac7df80d28c25d76e71012e8d52d5.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro: Premium Design and Advanced Fitness Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eNow available in a versatile Cream White color, Xiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro blends style with powerful fitness tracking. Its narrow-edge quadrilateral AMOLED display features a 77% screen-to-body ratio,¹⁷ offering a more immersive viewing experience. The 336 x 480 resolution¹⁷ and auto brightness adjustment with a maximum brightness of 1200 nits¹⁷ ensure clear visibility in bright light. With a 350mAh battery, it delivers up to 21 days of battery life,¹¹ making it an excellent companion for active users.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro enhances health tracking¹³\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003ewith a 15% improvement²¹ in heart rate monitoring accuracy, supporting 24/7 monitoring of heart rate,²² blood oxygen,²³ and stress levels. It features professional sleep tracking with in-depth reports and tailored improvement suggestions. This band supports 150+ sports modes, built-in GNSS for precise outdoor tracking, and 3D exercise animations to guide workouts.²⁴ A new built-in compass function provides direction guidance for outdoor sports, enhancing navigation during hikes and runs. Designed for both function and style, Xiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro also offers a variety of strap options, including TPU, leather, and magnetic designs.²⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/157_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/02/2025/e548287fe29d2cc32f6b356f8390a2ed.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro, Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi), Xiaomi Watch S4, Xiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max, and Xiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro will be available in a new Cream White color through Xiaomi's official channels and authorized retailers. Please visit\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003emi.com/global\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;for more detailed information on these products and their features.²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro: Priced starting at €199.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi): Priced starting at €219.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Watch S4: Priced starting at €159.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max: Priced starting at €599.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro in a new Cream White variant: Priced starting at €79.99\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eProduct images are available here:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Ev_zSm9DtBdMiPlK3PgtELQBMqznPfLf6kALS8vt5f4QPw?e=VHrirG\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EvyiD9jMOjBMjjw2ZwDjNSoBi5QtUKDv8dO1rXI27mbh5g?e=a5kr0I\"\u003eXiaomi Buds 5 Pro (Wi-Fi)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Eo5WDvUuGJ5PgnYsnZ63BSUBScj8mvURt9j8QqS3AyWVog?e=nYtmiA\"\u003eXiaomi Watch S4\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EuLQ46YmttJMsO8_tiD5BvQBzQz8ry4QM_lSaSdhzM8f-g?e=b6GRw1\"\u003eXiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Max\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EhAocUfsolxMhii5-kCkwCkB0RwWgNqFjkZ-zFNGLNtsGg?e=DL1zvA\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 9 Pro\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Qualcomm, aptX, Snapdragon and Snapdragon Sound are trademarks or registered trademarks of Qualcomm Incorporated. Snapdragon and Qualcomm branded products are products of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Please visit\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;for supported models.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e³\u0026nbsp;Noise cancellation depth test data provided by the National Institute of Metrology, China. The product reaches 55dB ANC depth only at a certain frequency range. Actual results may vary depending on usage conditions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ Please download Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;Earbuds\u0026nbsp;app to enjoy the new\u0026nbsp;personalized dimensional audio test. Please visit\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e for supported models.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ The battery level is 100%, the volume of the earbuds is adjusted to 50%, the Bluetooth encoding mode is AAC, and Up to\u0026nbsp;4.5\u0026nbsp;hours of music playback from 10 minutes of charging when the ANC feature and dimensional audio are turned off.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Please download Xiaomi Earbuds app to enjoy this function.\u0026nbsp;And One of the earbuds needs to remain in the case with the case closed to activate this function.\u0026nbsp;Recording without the other person's permission might be a criminal and civil offense. Recordings are not permitted for commercial use and should comply with local laws and regulations, including the privacy rights of individuals involved. Xiaomi will not be responsible for any violations of law resulting from your actions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷\u0026nbsp;Please adjust the gesture via Bluetooth settings to enjoy this feature. Transcription and translation activate features powered by Xiaomi HyperAI. The function will be available starting in 2025 Q2. Visit\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;for supported models. Recording without the other person's permission might be a criminal and civil offense. Recordings are not permitted for commercial use and should comply with local laws and regulations, including the privacy rights of individuals involved. Xiaomi will not be responsible for any violations of law resulting from your actions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Each gesture control function can be adjusted via Xiaomi Earbuds app.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Please visit\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;for supported models. This feature applies when the smartphone and the earbuds are under Wi-Fi connection.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰\u0026nbsp;Display refresh rate may vary across different interfaces. Please refer to the actual usage scenario.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ The data on battery life is based on typical usage mode\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Data is derived from Xiaomi Internal Lab. The average accuracy is\u0026nbsp;up to\u0026nbsp;98%\u0026nbsp;in scenarios such as sitting, office reading, treadmill running, outdoor running, outdoor walking, and outdoor cycling. Accuracy during actual usage may vary due to individual differences, usage habits, and environmental factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³\u0026nbsp;This product and its features are not designed for medical purposes and are not intended to predict, diagnose, prevent, or cure any disease.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴\u0026nbsp;To use the Xiaomi Smart Hub, the watch needs to be connected to a Xiaomi smartphone or pad supporting the latest version of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 and running the latest version of the Mi Fitness app and version 10.4 or above of the Xiaomi Home app.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵\u0026nbsp;1000W is the maximum power. Actual results may vary based on different usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Maximum speed may vary by country/region and is subject to local laws and regulations. Please visit\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;for more information. Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary based on different usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷\u0026nbsp;Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary based on different usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸\u0026nbsp;Tested when fully charged with a load of 75±5kg on a flat road, riding at a uniform speed of 15km/h with an ambient temperature of (25±5)°C and a wind speed of ≤3m/s until the vehicle could no longer be ridden. Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary based on different usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;A fast charger needs to be purchased separately. Does not support other brands' fast chargers. Fast charging time tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary based on different usage scenarios.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁰\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Auto light needs to be enabled manually. When it is enabled, adjusting the light manually on the scooter will temporarily disable the auto function, and it will be enabled again after turning off and restarting the scooter.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Compared with Xiaomi Smart Band 8 Pro. Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²²\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;When continuous monitoring of heart rate is turned on to Smart mode, the frequency of monitoring is automatically increased to once a minute every time activity is detected.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²³\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;When all-day tracking of blood oxygen is turned on, the test is performed every 10 minutes when at rest.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁴\u0026nbsp;This feature is only available for selected sports modes.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁵\u0026nbsp;Comes with an Obsidian Black/ Moonlight Silver/ Rose Gold TPU or Cream White leather inbox strap as standard. Other straps must be purchased separately.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁶\u0026nbsp;Please check local sales channels for specific availability in your region. And prices listed below reflect European sales prices of the devices sold. Global prices may vary depending on VAT, taxes, and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁷\u0026nbsp; The function is initially compatible with Xiaomi Buds 5 Pro, Xiaomi Buds 4 Pro and more. The availability of this feature on more earphone models is subject to the release schedule of corresponding smartphone OTA updates. Please visit \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;for more details.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁸\u0026nbsp; The function of controlling Xiaomi Home devices is available only when connected to the Xiaomi 15 Ultra via OTA starting in March 2025, and to the Xiaomi 15 via OTA starting in April 2025. More available models will be updated later on\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cem\u003emi.com/global\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2024, the MAU reached approximately 685.8 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 861.4 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2024. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"972","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1740925979"},"common":null}